# castle-probe.vrs: Castle Events spike 1. Does the static tile map see castle-built walls and floors? Writes a probe
# and an ASCII map at Chaos's home spot; the map is compared with the screenshot by hand.
# Needs: CastleEvents.Enabled=true; TPHome lands inside Chaos's castle.
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
mark
chat .uriel unit probe home
expect-log \[Uriel PROBE\] label=home .*hlevel=\d+
chat .uriel unit probemap home 12
expect-log \[Uriel PROBE\] map-end label=home level=\d+ blocked=\d+
expect-log \[Uriel PROBE\] map-end label=home level=\d+ blocked=\d+
shot full castle-probe-home
